Open the sidemenu
Click the "E-Chart" link
Type "Thompson" in the "sstring" input
Click the "Search" button
Click the "TEST-10065" link
Click the "Add Visit" link
Open the "Tests & procedures" dynamicsection
	@Wait for section to finish@driver.wcutils.waitForAJAX
	Enter "Animal Exposure (Allergy) Entry with Membership" in the "procedureorderac_txt" autocomplete
	Click the "Evaluate" button
	Verify exists "Successfully Evaluated" text
	Click the "OK" popup button
	Verify !exists "Animal Exposure (Allergy) Entry with Membership" text
Advance the dynamicsection
@removeSeleniumsAbilityToAddPeopleToPanels@driver.miedb.dbExec("INSERT INTO security_exception (user_id, module_name, category_name, security_value, comment) VALUES (8, 'Health Surveillance', 'Membership', 0, 'test')")
	Verify !exists "Evaluate" button
